Environment for perf_20190130_repro_latency.log and perf_20190130_repro_throughput.log (the perf_latency and
perf_throughput runs below). The same batch also ran lob_replay --differential (first) and itch_count (last); those
two logs are not in results/. The binaries were built into a scratch directory, shown below as bin/; the runs used the
directory holding 01302019.NASDAQ_ITCH50 as their working directory.
